is associated with a reduction in campaign duration of up to
{{ max_periods - min_periods }}~periods
({{ "%.1f"|format((max_periods - min_periods) * 7 / 30) }}~months),
implying an average marginal exchange rate of roughly
{{ "%.1f"|format((max_periods - min_periods) / (max_launches - min_launches)) if (max_launches - min_launches) > 0 else '---' }}~periods
saved per additional launch.
